    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs could be great for creating personalized stories or historical contexts around math concepts. Since I love history and philosophy, I imagine it could make numbers more relatable. But I worry that relying too much on AI might make people anxious if the explanations aren’t clear. It needs a human touch to be truly effective."
